[4]) Screw conveyor can be curved transportation.[
]5)[ Combined], compound and large-scale transportation mode[.] Screw convey[ors] are co-used with various kinds of continuous conveying equip[ments][ to][ finish] complicated material handling.[ Large]-[scale] transportation includes large capacity, the length of single conveyor and high angle conveying, etc.

