]Once the dough has rested enough ([a] few hours or days), roll out and place into a 9 inch fluted tart pan (this will also work in a pie[ dish]). Place in freezer while you make the filling and topping.
Dice nectarines (leave the[ skin][ on]) and combine with sugar, flour, cinnamon and rum. Set aside and make the[ topping]. In a bowl, combine ingredients for filling. Using your fingers, work ingredients[ together] (feel[ free] to add more pistach[ios][ if] you’[d] like) until the texture of coarse crumbs.
